   {
    "id": "revenant-feature-3",
    "name": "Tough But Withered",
    "description": "When your Stamina reaches the negative of your winded value, you become inert instead of dying. You fall prone and can\u2019t stand. You continue to observe your surroundings, but you can\u2019t speak, take main actions, maneuvers, move actions, or triggered actions. While inert this way, if you take any fire damage, your body is destroyed and you die. Otherwise, after 12 hours, you regain Stamina equal to your recovery value.",
    "type": "Text",
    "data": null
   },
   {
