               "minLevel": 1,
               "sections": [
                {
                 "type": "text",
                 "text": "Until the end of the encounter or until you are dying, at the end of each of your turns, you can slide each creature in the area up to a number of squares equal to your Intuition score. This forced movement ignores stability for your allies."
                }
