               "repeatable": false,
               "minLevel": 1,
               "sections": [
                {
                 "type": "text",
                 "text": "Before the target dies, you can look at their stat block and force them to use one ability that is a main action or a maneuver. If the ability costs a Heroic Resource or Malice, the creature can use it without any cost. For the purpose of using this ability, your allies and enemies are the target\u2019s allies and enemies, and you decide who the ability targets."
